Modifications: HBFCity replaces PGSimCity's PostgreSQL model, districts and
content with a GPU package carrying High Bandwidth Flash stacks. Files copied
from PGSimCity with little or no change: src/core/bus.ts, src/core/util.ts,
src/engine/color-grade.ts. The renderer, theme and registry follow PGSimCity's
designs in reduced form.

